menu "RGB LED"

    config RGB_LED_GPIO
        int "GPIO of the addressable RGB LED (WS2812)"
        range 0 48
        default 48
        help
            ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 v1.0 (and most N16R8 clones) wire the on-board RGB LED to GPIO48;
            v1.1 moved it to GPIO38. Try 38 if the LED stays dark.

endmenu
